---
const { items, sources } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="caution-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Before you decide</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title" id="caution-title">시술 전 꼭 확인하세요</h2>
    <div class="box" data-reveal>
      <ul>{items.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}</ul>
      <p class="src">의료 정보 참고: {sources.map((s) => <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.label}</a>)}. 개인별 진료를 대체하지 않습니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .box { background: var(--ice); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px); }
  li { position: relative; padding: 8px 0 8px 18px; }
  li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 1.1em; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); }
  .src { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
